.TH MYSTRNCPY 3 "September 2026" "OS Assignment 01" "Library Functions"

.SH NAME
mystrncpy \- copy a limited number of characters

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.br
.B int mystrncpy(char *dest, const char *src, int n);

.SH DESCRIPTION
The mystrncpy function copies up to n characters from the string pointed to by src into the destination buffer pointed to by dest.

